#: data/io.github.oatbiscuit.bloom.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"Bloom is a private and native cycle tracker. It helps you understand your "
"body's patterns by predicting upcoming periods and ovulation days without "
"ever sending your data to the cloud."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.oatbiscuit.bloom.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "Features:"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.oatbiscuit.bloom.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid ""
"Predict upcoming periods and ovulation days using a rolling median of your "
"last 6 cycles."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.oatbiscuit.bloom.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid ""
"Log basal body temperature, cervical mucus, and ovulation test (OPK) results."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.oatbiscuit.bloom.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Keep track of physical symptoms and daily notes."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.oatbiscuit.bloom.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid ""
"View personalised insights, including your average cycle length and "
"regularity."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.oatbiscuit.bloom.metainfo.xml.in:23
msgid ""
"All data is stored locally on your device using SQLite. No accounts, no "
"clouds, no tracking."
msgstr ""

